<body data-time="present" class="tab-present">
  <header class="site"><div class="wrap bar">
    <a class="brand" href="/">Vault <b>Human</b></a>
    <nav class="navlinks"><a href="/as-learned/">As Learned</a><a href="/as-loved/">As Loved</a><a href="/as-lived/">As Lived</a><a href="/#pricing">Pricing</a><a class="btn btn-acc" href="/#start" data-open-form>Start — $97/mo</a></nav>
  </div></header>
  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="wrap hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy">
        <div class="timeword"><span class="tw past">Past</span><span class="tw present on">Present</span><span class="tw future">Future</span></div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Life, as loved</p>
        <h1>The life you're <em>actually in.</em></h1>
        <p class="lede">Not the one you planned. This one. Being mindful is the work: noticing what is here, and loving it enough to change it.</p>
        <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Start — $97/mo</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="#who">Who this is for</a></div>
      </div><div class="hero-photo"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1529156069898-49953e39b3ac?w=1400&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Friends with arms around each other looking at the water" width="1400" height="933" fetchpriority="high" /></div></div>
    </section>

    <section class="sec" id="what"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">What we look at</p><h2>The things happening right now.</h2><p class="lede">Your body, your attention, your relationships, your work this week.</p></div>
      <div class="pains"><div class="pain"><h3>Your body</h3><p>Sleep, the walk, the table. The Body Vault starts on your feet, every other day.</p></div><div class="pain"><h3>Your attention</h3><p>Where it goes, who gets it, what it costs you. Noticing is the first skill.</p></div><div class="pain"><h3>Your people</h3><p>The conversation you keep not having. We rehearse it, then you have it.</p></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec alt" id="who"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Who this is for</p><h2>Three kinds of people start here.</h2></div>
      <div class="steps"><div class="step"><div class="n">01</div><h3>Individuals</h3><p>You want someone in the room every week who reads what you write.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">02</div><h3>Executives and leaders</h3><p>You carry real decisions and nobody around you can be fully honest with you.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">03</div><h3>Families and couples</h3><p>You want one rhythm in the house instead of four schedules and no shared language.</p></div></div>
      <p class="offers-note">Every path starts the same way: the daily lesson at $97 a month, then a 30-minute call with Russ. <a href="/#pricing">See pricing.</a></p>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec dark" id="company"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Coaching, specifically</p><h2>Need executive, leadership or communication coaching?</h2><p class="lede">Every Vault Human coaching program is delivered by Triplicity Advisory: the Coached Year, the Family Year, and Executive and Team. If you are a leader who wants a specific engagement for yourself or your team, go straight there.</p></div>
      <div class="ctarow" style="justify-content:center"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="https://triplicityadvisory.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Yes, take me to Triplicity ↗</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#" data-open-form>No, I want coaching</a></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec final" id="begin"><div class="wrap">
      <h2>Start with the present.</h2><p class="lede">Sign up tonight. Your first lesson is in your inbox at 7 a.m.</p>
      <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Start — $97/mo</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="/">Back to Vault Human</a></div>
    </div></section>
  </main>
  <footer class="site"><div class="wrap foot">
    <div><a class="brand" href="/">Vault <b>Human</b></a><p>Daily coaching. $97 a month.</p><p><a href="mailto:vault@vaulthuman.com">vault@vaulthuman.com</a> · <a href="tel:+18888332510">(888) 833-2510</a></p></div>
